WEBVTT

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.020
That's pretty good.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:58.840
No wonder you're a fan of monsters, Ryota.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.300
You've got pretty good eyes, Teacher.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.810
But there's something wrong here.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.480
Where?

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.980
What are we doing in class right now?

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:11.440
Ah, could it be math time?

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.400
Yep.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.400
You would be in good shape if it were art class, but it's not.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.170
Please let me go this time...

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:19.820
No!

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.280
Go stand in the hall and reflect on what you've done.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.780
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:25.990
Okay then, time for the next problem.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:29.230
Doremi-chan, if you don't wake up, Seki-sensei is going to see you!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.960
That ain't gonna work, she won't wake up like that.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.920
Doremi-chan! Wake up!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.380
It's a monster!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.400
Oh no...

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:53.470
Ryota and the Monster of the Night.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.860
It was so scary!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.320
It was looking at me with this kind of face!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:09.160
Well then, have you all thought about what you're going to make for the fall show?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.740
Not yet!

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.790
How about the people who don't know what they're going to do?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.250
Here!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.910
You can make anything!

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.760
Just make it something you love.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.580
Somethin' I love?

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:22.290
I have a lotta things I love.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:26.180
Takoyaki, okonomiyaki, oily tofu...

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.180
They're all foods.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.810
What I love...

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:31.730
is only one thing.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.480
That's not right!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.480
Make the eyes more curvy!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.400
That's it! Ryota-kun, you're so good!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.190
Of course.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.370
Did it have claws?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.840
Claws?

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.230
Um... I think...

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:48.830
So did it?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.250
Who cares about that, draw the mouth first!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:52.710
Hey!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.330
That's it! Right on!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.290
Who said I was a monster!?

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.280
T-Teacher...

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:02.720
Ryota, I know you love monsters, but do you know why you're standing out here?

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.520
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.930
Looks like you aren't reflecting at all.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.100
No more!

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.300
I wonder if Doremi-chan is done cleaning yet.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.100
There's only Ryota-kun here.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.900
You came for me!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:28.320
It was too much, having the two of us clean this huge place!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.970
Yeah, yeah. I guess yer right.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.290
She shoulda had y'all clean the bathroom instead.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.480
Clean the bathroom?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.790
I don't want that either!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.170
Calm down.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.960
We can finish this super quick if we all work together.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.550
Thank you!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.590
You really are my most loyal of friends!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.220
Hey, Ryota!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.570
Kimura-kun, you guys came to help out too?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:49.700
Who asked you!?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.850
Ryota, it's time for soccer practice.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.520
Just leave the rest to them.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.100
Who asked you!?

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.800
I can't go today.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.110
I have other things to do.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.620
That won't do.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:02.300
The game with Aozora Elementary is coming up.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.570
Ahh, that's the team who wrecked you guys last time.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.710
Shut up!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:07.530
We'll definitely win this time!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.680
Of course!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:09.500
Let's do it!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:10.400
Yeah!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.640
I'm sorry.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.160
I'll cheer you guys on during the game.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.210
Looks like we're out of luck.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:22.900
It's an insect.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:23.550
Nope.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.050
A larva with a stomach ache?

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.170
Nope.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.440
I got it! It's an alien that crash landed on Earth!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.430
Nope!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:34.290
I pass.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.480
Why are you all guessing what I'm making!?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.440
Well, that's natural.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.970
It's all because you make nothing but weird crap!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.650
What? My stuff isn't weird at all.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.820
I'm finished.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.740
Looks delicious.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:52.920
This is my favorite thing! My family's homemade jumbo takoyaki.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.480
These look pretty good, let me have a taste.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.490
No way.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:59.080
I made 'em from dishwashin' sponges!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.220
You did what?

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.530
I'm done too!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.990
How is it? I want Okuyama-san to wear this.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.720
That's a bit overboard.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.180
Eh? A witch?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.020
That weird thing was a witch?

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.980
Yeah, I've loved witches since I was little.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.230
Oh yeah, you were always reading up on them.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.650
I always believed that I'd meet a real witch.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.420
But ya did meet one, Majo Rika.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:30.170
It was a bit different than I imagined.

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:32.350
Yeah, it's completely different!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:36.580
Oh? Isn't that Ryota-kun?

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.610
Gazamadon is here!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:44.140
Earth Defense Force, attack!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.530
Attack!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.480
Looks like Ryota-kun's having fun.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.640
Triple step attack!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.650
That looked bad.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:03.610
Take this!

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.220
Let's bury him!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.420
Oh my. Isn't that going a bit too far?

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.120
Yeah, let's go save him!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:13.530
Alright!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.660
Yeah! We defeated the monster!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.220
Hey, you guys! Stop that right now!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.540
It's the Hairbun Monster!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.840
What did you say!?

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.970
Get her!

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.040
Doremi-chan!

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.510
Now she's the Sand Spitting Monster!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.070
Stop right there!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.740
How come she's playin' along with 'em now?

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:45.620
You okay?

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:46.220
Yeah...

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.080
What was that?

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.620
The clown monster is mad!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.350
Clown monster?

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:52.150
Who're you talkin' about!?

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:56.450
Even Ai-chan too.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.410
Come out right now!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.650
Hey, clown monster, we're right here!

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.410
Hey!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.840
Come catch us!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.790
Over here!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.480
How weak!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.360
Are you okay? Are you hurt anywhere?

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:17.200
No...

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:17.990
Hey.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:18.810
What is it?

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:23.000
I can let you join the Earth Defense Force.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.150
Thank you.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.260
What did you say?

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:29.060
Come on now, help dig him out.

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:38.280
He said he was busy, but all he's doing is playing monster games?

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.400
Is that more important than soccer?

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.780
But it seems kinda fun.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:44.570
What?

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:48.710
Big brother Ryota, we'll come play again!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.990
Okay, later!

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:53.370
Ahh, Ryota-kun, you're hurt.

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:55.900
It's fine, it's fine.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.310
It's just a scrape.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.190
What's all this?

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:11.120
There's so much.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.450
He has so many of these.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.720
And they're all the same.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.000
It's so cute!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.460
What's it doing?

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.420
My my my, this again?

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.380
Ryota-kun, do something.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.380
That's a piggy bank, so you have to put some money in.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.050
D-Doremi-chan, here.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.900
Hey, that's Hadzuki-chan's money!

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.470
Give it back!

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.320
Here, Hadzuki-chan.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.980
It seems kinda stinky now.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:53.360
Did you make all these monsters, Ryota-kun?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.650
Yeah, because Gazamadon is my favorite monster.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:00.320
Jeez, monsters, monsters, enough of that!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:05.070
The neighboring children all call you Big Brother Monster.

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:07.970
And you got hurt today playing monster games.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:10.500
How did you do on your math test, anyway?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.260
I placed it over there.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:15.660
45 percent!? What!?

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.500
If you get something like this again, I'll throw away all of your monsters!

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.380
What!?

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:21.500
You can't do that!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:25.140
Your head is full of monsters, that's why.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:30.980
It's fine, I did worse than you.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:31.880
Take a look.

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:34.040
Ya don't have to take that out.

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.510
Onpu-chan, what's yer display gonna be?

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:09.200
What's your favorite thing?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.020
That... is a secret!

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:14.870
Hey, we're goin' on ahead to the Maho-dou.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:15.980
Do yer best!

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.740
That's nice, that both of you are finished.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.700
I'm sorry, Doremi-chan.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.660
Ryota! The game is starting. Hurry up!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.660
Okay.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:29.110
You ain't gonna win anyway. Thanks for tryin' yer best th-

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:31.460
We will definitely beat them today!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.470
Yeah!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:37.510
Ryota-kun, I heard you're making Gazamadon.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.000
Yeah.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:38.630
Here you go.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:42.310
I'm filming Gazamadon Part 2 right now.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:42.840
Take a look.

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:44.900
L-Let me see!

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.600
Wow, awesome!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.560
Look, look, it's the same Gazamadon.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.520
Anyway, do your best on making him.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.070
Hey, hey! Please tell me about the movie!

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.690
I have to go film now, so I'll see you tomorrow.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.400
Be sure to tell me then!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.320
I'm beginning to hate this look.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:06.780
We're here!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.240
What? What happened to Doremi?

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.170
She's still making her display object at school.

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:15.900
I don't think she'll make anything good.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:17.250
That ain't true.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.700
Doremi-chan is tryin' her best this time.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:23.180
She has no talent, so she's just wasting work.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.640
She has a good model, so I think she'll do a fabulous job.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.220
So what's Doremi's model?

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:30.720
Majo Rika.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.020
What? I'm the model?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.120
Yeah.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.980
Doremi-chan's makin' her most favorite thing.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.090
Isn't that great?

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:42.740
Yeah, well... Um... I... That's uh...

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.610
It's nothin' to be embarrassed over.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:48.080
Wow! It's awesome!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.410
Really?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.520
Yeah! It's so cool!

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:54.600
Hey, Ryota!

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:55.840
Why...

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:56.130
Didn't...

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.330
You come to the game!?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.780
Did you win?

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.230
14-1.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.420
Wow!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.910
We lost!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.640
We practiced so much!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.730
Darn it all! This is all your fault!

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:08.350
I'm sorry.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.140
I was making this, that's why.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.640
Heh! You're just a monster otaku!

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.100
Hey, that's so mean!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.530
Really?

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:19.570
You said you were coming to the game, but you forgot about it.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.570
Is your monster more important than our game?

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.030
Jeez, you otaku!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.030
Otaku, otaku!

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.990
And monsters aren't even what's cool right now!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.290
Yeah, really. How lame.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:31.950
Let's go!

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.900
Wow, I'm so mad!

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:35.890
Wait, you two!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.670
Go apologize to Ryota-kun!

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:38.380
Make me!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.380
Sorry fer the wait, but we brought ya some snacks.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.630
A-Are ya mad at me?

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.900
No! I'm mad at Kimura and Kotake!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.240
I hate you!

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.100
What monsters!? Screw it, screw it, screw it!

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.940
Stop that! You worked so hard to make that!

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:58.980
It's all because I'm so into monsters that the teacher and my mom got mad at me.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.280
Even my friends hate me.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:04.290
I've had enough of monsters!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.870
Wait, Ryota-kun!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.910
Man, it's all messed up now.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:13.820
Ryota-kun!

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:16.560
You were lying about hating monsters, right?

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:19.140
I hate them, I hate them, I hate them so much!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:28.740
Ahh... what should we do?

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:32.170
I feel so sorry for Ryota-kun.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:34.880
Yer right... but what <i>can</i>  we do?

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:38.840
Let's use magic to fix up his monster.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.480
But will that make him feel better?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:48.570
Then let's use magic to make him like monsters again.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:52.910
That won't do, because we can't use magic to alter people's minds.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.210
But...

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.890
I can't think of anything else!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.460
What should we do, Hadzuki-chan?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.290
Now's the time for Magical Stage!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:18.040
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.380
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:25.190
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:28.420
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:35.110
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.480
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.860
Magical Stage!

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.950
Please help Ryota-kun somehow!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.570
Did you hear that?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.750
I wonder what happened to Ryota-kun.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:18.880
Let's go see him!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.340
Nothing's changed.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.300
Did our magic fail?

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.650
What should we do?

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:51.400
A-An earthquake?

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.740
What's that?

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.210
A-A monster!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.420
Doremi-chan!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:24.470
Ai-chan.

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:25.290
That's...

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.140
Hadzuki-chan.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:27.180
Don't tell me...

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:29.570
That's what our magic made this afternoon?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.860
Gazamadon...

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.180
Gazamadon!

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.580
Wait!

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:13.730
Please, wait for me!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.540
I said wait!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.700
I'm sorry, Gazamadon!

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:33.250
I...

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.710
I said I hated you, but...

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.420
Ryota-kun!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.850
It was all a lie!

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.810
I really...

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.770
I love you!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.780
He'll get eaten!

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:49.810
We have to save him!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.340
Wait!

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:52.230
I don't think that's going to happen.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:19:00.440
I'm so happy that I got to see you.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.160
It's a demon!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.380
So I'm dreaming.

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:45.510
Are you leaving already?

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.660
Gazamadon...

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:57.680
Please wait!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:08.130
I... I will always love you, forever and ever!!!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.370
I love you!!!

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:28.990
G-Good morning.

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:30.450
Yo.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:33.540
Um...

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.800
I had a dream about a monster last night!

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:37.870
Me too!

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.300
It was so big!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.390
It was so cool!

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:42.720
Oh? And?

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.040
And...

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.220
I shouldn't have made fun of monsters. I'm sorry.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.120
Me too. I'm sorry.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.880
Me too, I forgot to go to the game.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.030
I'm really sorry.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:55.650
I'll help you!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:56.710
Me too!

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:57.500
Thank you!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.560
Everyone, set up your displays.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:03.570
Okay!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.730
Ta-da!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:06.890
What's that?

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:08.740
This is my favorite thing.

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.580
And of course, it-is-me.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.590
How's that possible?

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:13.230
Here!

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.540
Gazamadon Part 2!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.910
Please go see it!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.040
Here, here, for you!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.130
She's so resourceful.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.570
Which one is Doremi's?

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:22.940
Majo Rika!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:27.010
She said she had to see your display no matter what, so I brought her along.

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:28.870
Wh-?

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.420
What's this!?

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:31.430
Don't look at it!

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.770
So this is Majo Rika.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:36.720
Yep, before she became a Witch Frog.

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.350
So she looked like this.

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:42.620
This is the first time I've seen her, but I think she's cuter now.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:43.100
Yeah.

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:44.690
She's much better than this form.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:49.510
Yep, Majo Rika is probably happier as a Witch Frog!

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:50.660
Don't screw with me!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:53.020
Gold

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.370
Yay!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.450
Everyone, listen to me!

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:06.600
Someone wants me to be his girlfriend!

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:08.450
He fell in love with me at first sight.

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:11.990
I'm now the world's happiest pretty girl!

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:13.970
She's completely in love.

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:16.460
But Doremi-chan finally fell in love, thank goodness.

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:19.980
Even though it's fall already, this Harukaze's heart is filled with the winds of spring! (Harukaze = Spring breeze)

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:21.380
Ai-chan, let's go home.

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:22.350
Yeah, really.

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:23.520
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:25.740
Doremi's Boyfriend is a Middle School Student!

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:28.400
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
